+  - [`src/dist.cpp`](/home/hep7/project/kairos/libzmq/src/dist.cpp)
+  - [`src/pipe.cpp`](/home/hep7/project/kairos/libzmq/src/pipe.cpp)
+- `claude` consult 여부와 핵심 조언
